   "actionTime": "10:15:53",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of S. 5 with 1 hour and 30 minutes of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions. Measure will be considered read. A specified amendment is in order.",
